{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Face the Dangers of Nebegarde </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhospitable open-air prison on the icy side of a distant planet, where the worst criminals are sent with their memories erased. Venture forth and immerse yourself in a dense plot filled with dilemmas and choices that will reveal the different faces of a reality previously unknown as you seek to understand the reason for your own exile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Alliances </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships with various NPCs; depending on your decisions, some may join your adventure as companions. Switch control between them in real-time, accessing unique challenges and previously inaccessible areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7c70fc1c3fd387f905aa202f111f883c.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7c70fc1c3fd387f905aa202f111f883c.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7c70fc1c3fd387f905aa202f111f883c.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/409267a8c5495f9d50183232de762647.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/409267a8c5495f9d50183232de762647.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/409267a8c5495f9d50183232de762647.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture Solo or in Cooperation </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on this challenge alone or enjoy party moments by inviting a friend to join in split-screen with local or online multiplayer (via Remote Play Together).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/38f8e9b57422f4108ef91c40ca16367f.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/38f8e9b57422f4108ef91c40ca16367f.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/38f8e9b57422f4108ef91c40ca16367f.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use N'skita Crystals to imbue your equipment with special properties. Insert them into available sockets and witness the results\u2014both in the attributes of your gear (damage type, defense, etc.) and in the visual effects seen in your attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face Unique Enemies </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge creatures ranging from native beings of a new planet to genetically modified creatures and even futuristic machines. Encounter creations inspired by mythological elements from various cultures and Brazilian folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Combat </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With combat requiring strategy and skill, <strong>Goldilock One</strong> offers a unique blend of hack 'n' slash against multiple enemies and more paced moments with challenging foes that will demand more self-preservation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have two combat modes to develop the main character\u2019s skills: Gauntlet and Shield, and the classic Two-Handed Axe. In addition, you\u2019ll be able to use various other modes by controlling the NPCs you manage to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7a4472c314219ab3f2a81fb67b51c14b.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7a4472c314219ab3f2a81fb67b51c14b.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7a4472c314219ab3f2a81fb67b51c14b.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and loot resources to be used in crafting recipes that can be completed with NPCs. If managed well, your results can bring advantages to your journey, including potions, food, and even equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combat simulator to hone your abilities. A secret training capsule created so that exiles can secretly increase their chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/772f3b45a04c735f2b2c05dab60d9802.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/772f3b45a04c735f2b2c05dab60d9802.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/772f3b45a04c735f2b2c05dab60d9802.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Capsule, we\u2019ll have some extra game modes such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (solo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (co-op \u2013 split screen)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP (split screen)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Arena (unlock by expanding your bestiary)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chill Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/c735b56c81a56dfebf69787bd7bde62c8dde9733.jpg"},{"name":"Double Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/037905e4824efea35e29cf5696bf31d06f1c1a34.jpg"},{"name":"First blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/260f85baeea9934d7efc7e93091edacff93f3cfc.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 10 Foremen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/d1fad59418f9198cbb4464e995eb928802bebec0.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 50 Foremen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/3b13e9839a9868dc26e7db33b5765c6c9d212fc6.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 100 Foremen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/01a0712b106cd2dc1a412643ff9c084c56895151.jpg"},{"name":"Mushroom Maniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/9f90bc7e1af2675d98b1e446a12e244652f01ade.jpg"},{"name":"They\u2019re Going to Drink This?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427790/c4c48227b297c74ccce2dbc319bd1511aabfa209.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2427790?t=1771852594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/9deacaf982297e8d2413857c533f2e35fe898967/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771852594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/a2184d94c49f4ae24f3412359dfeb4be94aa5891/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771852594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/a2184d94c49f4ae24f3412359dfeb4be94aa5891/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771852594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gameplay consists of frequent combat scenarios with characters using their weapon to slash enemies.\r\n\r\nStrong Language is used in the dialogue."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3202170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/cc42b162f7cf25c39137efc48ba9bef9.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1560 height=3120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/4830ed9f3f141c3e25ca46571bc7fe1b.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1560 height=2627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Face the Dangers of Nebegarde </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhospitable open-air prison on the icy side of a distant planet, where the worst criminals are sent with their memories erased. Venture forth and immerse yourself in a dense plot filled with dilemmas and choices that will reveal the different faces of a reality previously unknown as you seek to understand the reason for your own exile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Alliances </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships with various NPCs; depending on your decisions, some may join your adventure as companions. Switch control between them in real-time, accessing unique challenges and previously inaccessible areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7c70fc1c3fd387f905aa202f111f883c.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7c70fc1c3fd387f905aa202f111f883c.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7c70fc1c3fd387f905aa202f111f883c.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/409267a8c5495f9d50183232de762647.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/409267a8c5495f9d50183232de762647.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/409267a8c5495f9d50183232de762647.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture Solo or in Cooperation </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on this challenge alone or enjoy party moments by inviting a friend to join in split-screen with local or online multiplayer (via Remote Play Together).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/38f8e9b57422f4108ef91c40ca16367f.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/38f8e9b57422f4108ef91c40ca16367f.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/38f8e9b57422f4108ef91c40ca16367f.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use N'skita Crystals to imbue your equipment with special properties. Insert them into available sockets and witness the results\u2014both in the attributes of your gear (damage type, defense, etc.) and in the visual effects seen in your attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face Unique Enemies </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge creatures ranging from native beings of a new planet to genetically modified creatures and even futuristic machines. Encounter creations inspired by mythological elements from various cultures and Brazilian folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Combat </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With combat requiring strategy and skill, <strong>Goldilock One</strong> offers a unique blend of hack 'n' slash against multiple enemies and more paced moments with challenging foes that will demand more self-preservation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have two combat modes to develop the main character\u2019s skills: Gauntlet and Shield, and the classic Two-Handed Axe. In addition, you\u2019ll be able to use various other modes by controlling the NPCs you manage to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7a4472c314219ab3f2a81fb67b51c14b.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7a4472c314219ab3f2a81fb67b51c14b.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/7a4472c314219ab3f2a81fb67b51c14b.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and loot resources to be used in crafting recipes that can be completed with NPCs. If managed well, your results can bring advantages to your journey, including potions, food, and even equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combat simulator to hone your abilities. A secret training capsule created so that exiles can secretly increase their chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/772f3b45a04c735f2b2c05dab60d9802.poster.avif?t=1771852594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/772f3b45a04c735f2b2c05dab60d9802.webm?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/extras/772f3b45a04c735f2b2c05dab60d9802.mp4?t=1771852594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Capsule, we\u2019ll have some extra game modes such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (solo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (co-op \u2013 split screen)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP (split screen)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Arena (unlock by expanding your bestiary)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Shed of Ideas"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427790/bb71f1064aa157923db4640836ef164d70393fa2/header.jpg?t=1771852594","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427790/1198481665/8662f14ff35235d08b712734f371291ea0f5ef44/1769962226/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769964403","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427790/1198481665/8662f14ff35235d08b712734f371291ea0f5ef44/1769962226/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769964403","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store